{
  "about": "Temporary credit extension (16 Nov 2026): a separate workflow; nothing existing changes. Manna Credit Extension is one extension, never overwritten - a GM renewal after a missed commitment is a new record linked by parent_extension. Its three child tables keep the audit history (log), the SAP payments counted against the commitment, once each by DocEntry (payments), and every SAP request and response (sap_log). Manna Credit Extension Settings holds the manager's approval authority and the SAP job's flag. System Manager only, like the other request doctypes: every read and write goes through the manna_credit_extension Server Script (credit_extension.py). SAP Sync Bot reads, to find the work for Sync-CreditExtensions.ps1; it reports back through the script. Child tables are created first.",
